:: TutorQuizClash
<div class="container">
  <h2>A Gentle Correction</h2>
  <div class="ai-text">
    AI: "Not quite! But that is a incredibly common misconception. In reality, both the United States and the Soviet Union desperately wanted to avoid direct military clashes due to the terrifying reality of nuclear deterrence. The Berlin Blockade was actually an economic and political counter-move protesting Western currency reforms in Germany. Stalin wanted to choke West Berlin economically to force the Allies to abandon their plans for a unified West German state. Understanding this distinction is key to an accurate, A-grade paper. Let's adjust our focus..."
  </div>
  <p>
    You read the correction, appreciating the clarity and the lack of judgment. The AI's explanation prevents you from building your entire paper on a fundamentally flawed historical premise. You feel a sense of gratitude as you prepare your outline.
  </p>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <a data-passage="Tutor Nuance" class="btn btn-purple">Ask the AI to explain the distinction between containment and economic aid.</a>
