:: Tutor Solo
<div class="container">
  <h2>Drafting the Framework</h2>
  <p>
    Armed with the highly logical outline provided by the AI, you open your textbook and begin to write. You don't ask any more questions or rely on the chat window; instead, you use the AI's structure as a reliable map while using the textbook and your lecture notes to supply the actual historical substance.
  </p>
  <p>
    The structure keeps you focused and prevents you from falling into the black holes of aimless research that usually waste hours of your time. You write with steady, confident progress, synthesizing the facts about European division and containment strategies.
