  <p>
    A week later, your grades are released. You got an <strong style="color: #81c784;">A- (90%)</strong>. Professor Vance writes:
  </p>
  <p style="color: #aaa; font-style: italic; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding: 15px; border-left: 3px solid #81c784; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.6;">
