:: The Hallucination
<div class="container">
  <h2 class="highlight">Called to the Office</h2>
  <p>
    You submit the raw AI output, close your screen, and fall into a twelve-hour sleep of pure exhaustion. Two days later, you wake up to an urgent email from Professor Vance: *Please visit my office immediately.*
  </p>
  <p>
    You sit down in the squeaky wooden chair across from him. The air is tense. Vance slowly slides your printed essay across the desk. Near the middle, a specific paragraph is highlighted in thick, bright red ink.
  </p>
  <p style="font-size: 1.2em; font-style: italic; color: #ffaa00; border-left: 3px solid #ffaa00; padding-left: 15px; margin: 20px 0; line-height: 1.6;">
    "I've been teaching modern geopolitics for thirty years," Vance says, leaning forward and staring right through you. "Can you tell me more about this 'Treaty of Neo-Berlin' you based your entire thesis on?"
  </p>

  <div style="background: rgba(255, 85, 85, 0.1); border: 1px solid #ff5555; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 25px 0; text-align: center;">
    <span style="color: #fff; font-size: 1.2em;">Time to respond: </span>
    <span id="countdown" style="color: #ff5555; font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.6em;">10</span>
  </div>

  <<script>>
    $(document).one(':passagedisplay', function () {
      var timeleft = 10;
      if (window.hallucinationTimer) {
        clearInterval(window.hallucinationTimer);
      }
      
      window.hallucinationTimer = setInterval(function () {
        timeleft--;
        var cd = document.getElementById("countdown");
        if (cd) {
          cd.innerHTML = timeleft;
        }
        if (timeleft <= 0) {
          clearInterval(window.hallucinationTimer);
          window.hallucinationTimer = null;
          if (cd) {
            cd.innerHTML = "0 - HE IS WAITING.";
            cd.style.color = "red";
          }
        }
      }, 1000);
    });
  <</script>>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
