    <p style="color: #ddd; font-size: 1.1em;">
      You receive a capped grade of <strong>70% (C-)</strong> on the essay. You saved your academic record, avoided a board referral, and salvaged your integrity. More importantly, you learned that real education is about the struggle of understanding, not outsourcing.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
