:: Academic Probation
<div class="container">
  <h2 class="highlight">The Integrity Board</h2>
  <p>
    "AI detectors are notoriously unreliable, Professor!" you argue, raising your voice in a desperate bid to defend your lie. "I spent hours researching obscure books in the basement of the library. I wrote every single word of this myself, and I won't be falsely accused!"
  </p>
  <p>
    Professor Vance's eyes go completely cold. He slowly closes your folder, the slap of the cardboard sounding like a gunshot in the quiet office.
  </p>
  <p>
    "I offered you a path of honesty," he says quietly. "Not only did you plagiarize, but you have chosen to double down on a blatant, demonstrable lie in my face. We are done here."
  </p>

  <div class="end-card end-bad">
    <h3 style="color: #ff5555; margin-top: 0;">BAD ENDING: Academic Probation</h3>
    <p style="color: #ddd; font-size: 1.1em;">
      You are formally reported to the Academic Integrity Board. Due to the blatant plagiarism and your subsequent attempt to deceive a faculty member, the board rejects all of your appeals. You receive an immediate <strong>F</strong> in the course, lose your academic scholarship, and are placed on formal academic probation. A permanent disciplinary mark is placed on your transcript.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <button onclick="SugarCube.Engine.restart()" class="btn btn-neutral">Restart Story</button>
  </div>
</div>

:: Honest Failure
<div class="container">
  <h2>A Painful Lesson</h2>
  <p>
    You look down at your hands, unable to meet his eyes. "I didn't write it, Professor," you say quietly, the weight of the lie lifting as you speak. "I panicked because of the midnight deadline, pasted the prompt into an AI, and submitted the output without even reading it. I was just so exhausted and scared."
  </p>
  <p>
    Professor Vance leans back in his leather chair. The sternness in his expression slowly softens into a quiet pity.
  </p>
  <p>
    "AI is a powerful technology," he says, "but when you let it do the thinking for you, it invents garbage, and you are the one who takes the fall. I appreciate your immediate honesty, however. It shows you still have a conscience."
  </p>

  <div class="end-card end-neutral">
    <h3 style="color: #4da6ff; margin-top: 0;">NEUTRAL ENDING: A Second Chance</h3>
    <p style="color: #ddd; font-size: 1.1em;">
      You receive an automatic <strong>zero</strong> on the essay, guaranteeing you will fail the class and have to retake it next semester. However, because you confessed immediately and took responsibility, Professor Vance decides not to file a formal academic dishonesty report. You learn a painful but necessary lesson about integrity.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <button onclick="SugarCube.Engine.restart()" class="btn btn-neutral">Restart Story</button>
  </div>
</div>

