    You take a deep, calm breath and smile. It was a grueling, exhausting night weeks ago when you chose to write that essay on your own, but the intense struggle forced the historical facts deep into your long-term memory. You don't need a chatbot. You know the material inside and out.
  </p>
  <p>
    You open the blue booklet and begin to write with absolute confidence.
